{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 3,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My son, forget not my law;\nBut let thy heart keep my commandments:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For length of days, and years of life,\nAnd peace, will they add to thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let not kindness and truth forsake thee:\nBind them about thy neck;\nWrite them upon the tablet of thy heart:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So shalt thou find favor and good understanding\nIn the sight of God and man.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Trust in Jehovah with all thy heart,\nAnd lean not upon thine own understanding:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In all thy ways acknowledge him,\nAnd he will direct thy paths.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be not wise in thine own eyes;\nFear Jehovah, and depart from evil:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "It will be health to thy navel,\nAnd marrow to thy bones.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Honor Jehovah with thy substance,\nAnd with the first-fruits of all thine increase:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So shall thy barns be filled with plenty,\nAnd thy vats shall overflow with new wine.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My son, despise not the chastening of Jehovah;\nNeither be weary of his reproof:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For whom Jehovah loveth he reproveth,\nEven as a father the son in whom he delighteth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Happy is the man that findeth wisdom,\nAnd the man that getteth understanding.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the gaining of it is better than the gaining of silver,\nAnd the profit thereof than fine gold.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "She is more precious than rubies:\nAnd none of the things thou canst desire are to be compared unto her.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Length of days is in her right hand;\nIn her left hand are riches and honor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Her ways are ways of pleasantness,\nAnd all her paths are peace.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "She is a tree of life to them that lay hold upon her:\nAnd happy is every one that retaineth her.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah by wisdom founded the earth;\nBy understanding he established the heavens.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By his knowledge the depths were broken up,\nAnd the skies drop down the dew.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My son, let them not depart from thine eyes;\nKeep sound wisdom and discretion:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So shall they be life unto thy soul,\nAnd grace to thy neck.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then shalt thou walk in thy way securely,\nAnd thy foot shall not stumble.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When thou liest down, thou shalt not be afraid:\nYea, thou shalt lie down, and thy sleep shall be sweet.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Be not afraid of sudden fear,\nNeither of the desolation of the wicked, when it cometh:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For Jehovah will be thy confidence,\nAnd will keep thy foot from being taken.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Withhold not good from them to whom it is due,\nWhen it is in the power of thy hand to do it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Say not unto thy neighbor, Go, and come again,\nAnd to-morrow I will give;\nWhen thou hast it by thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Devise not evil against thy neighbor,\nSeeing he dwelleth securely by thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Strive not with a man without cause,\nIf he have done thee no harm.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Envy thou not the man of violence,\nAnd choose none of his ways.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the perverse is an abomination to Jehovah;\nBut his friendship is with the upright.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The curse of Jehovah is in the house of the wicked;\nBut he blesseth the habitation of the righteous.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely he scoffeth at the scoffers;But he giveth grace unto the lowly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.3.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.3.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wise shall inherit glory;\nBut shame shall be the promotion of fools.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
